---
title: How the screen gets to the phone
board: 1500x700
---
flowchart LR
  subgraph mac [Mac · Helm Desktop]
    cap[ScreenCaptureKit<br>display or one window]:::hl
    enc[VideoToolbox H.264/HEVC<br>hardware, 30–60 fps]
    cur[Cursor tracker<br>position + shape]
    inj[Input injector<br>CGEvent, needs Accessibility]
    rpc[Helm server<br>RPC + /api/helm/screen]
  end
  subgraph phone [iPhone · Helm Mobile]
    dec[VTDecompressionSession<br>AVSampleBufferDisplayLayer]:::hl
    vp[Viewport<br>center = cursor, clamp, zoom]:::hl
    ges[Gestures<br>trackpad / touch / keys]
  end
  cap --> enc
  enc ==>|1. video frames, binary WS| dec
  cur -->|2. cursor moves, small JSON| vp
  ges ==>|3. move / click / scroll / keys| inj
  dec --> vp
  ges --> vp
  rpc -.->|start / stop / pick window, existing RPC| phone
